## Styler Tests

### Styler

What to test:

- Hover and toggle each series; the series `styler` applies fill, stroke and line dash for both low and high items.
- Marker overrides from the styler take effect on low/high markers.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler" name="styler" type="generated" /%}

### Styler & Item Styler

What to test:

- Series `styler` and marker `itemStyler` co-exist; February markers recolour via `itemStyler` while the series styler keeps its fill and stroke.
- Low/high marker size overrides apply on top of styler output.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler & Item Styler" name="styler-and-itemstyler" type="generated" /%}

### Styler Highlight State

What to test:

- Hover a single marker; the `highlighted-item` and `unhighlighted-item` branches change marker shape, fill and size.
- Hover a legend entry; the `highlighted-series` and `unhighlighted-series` branches dim other series and recolour the active one.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Styler Highlight State" name="styler-highlight-state" type="generated" /%}
